{
  "$schema": "https://tr.designtokens.org/format/",
  "$description": "Design tokens in the W3C Design Tokens (DTCG) format. THIS FILE IS THE SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the design system. Edit values here only -- do not hand-edit the generated src/index.css or src/generated/tokens.ts. The dev server regenerates them on every change (scripts/build-tokens.mjs, wired through vite.config.ts). Colors are authored as hex; the generator converts them to `H S% L%` channels for the web theme and keeps hex for mobile (tokens.ts). Every color role exists in both light and dark. Concept: Dead Channel -- a CRT tuned to nothing. Dark is the canonical mode (flat black; crimson signal, violet interference, orange/red heat); light is a derived 'printout' mode.",
